			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726510201,
					"content": "唉，難道我真是什麼「吸引仙靈體質」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510202,
					"content": "什麼「吸引仙靈體質」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510203,
					"content": "你是…旅行者？哎呀，你來得正好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510204,
					"content": "#我有一樁大生意，好生意！能賺到成噸的摩拉，不知道{F#妳}{M#你}有沒有興趣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510205,
						726510206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510205,
					"content": "那你自己為什麼不去做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510207,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}別這麼警惕嘛。{F#妳}{M#你}看，我就是個想來稻妻發一筆財的普通人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510208,
					"content": "稻妻不是正在鎖國嘛，我就找幾位好朋友想了想辦法，弄了一艘小船，準備渡海來稻妻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510209,
					"content": "但是，唉…但是我越接近稻妻，天氣就越怪，又是打雷，又是風暴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510210,
					"content": "然後，突然一道雷正巧劈在我的船上，船毀了，我也掉進了海裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510211,
					"content": "幾個浪頭拍過來，我喝了好幾口水，人也暈了過去，再醒來的時候，就在海灘上趴著了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510212,
					"content": "你運氣可真好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510213,
					"content": "哈哈哈，可不是嗎，我運氣一向不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510214,
					"content": "而且…呃…怎麼說呢，我上岸之後四處打探了一下，結果…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510215,
					"content": "就遇見了這小傢伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510216,
					"content": "仙、仙靈？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510217,
					"content": "準確地來說，它叫做「尋寶仙靈」。顧名思義，就是那種能帶著人找到寶藏的好夥伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510218,
					"content": "但是不知道為什麼，它帶著我去尋了幾處寶藏之後，突然就罷工了，只是一直跟在我身邊轉來轉去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510219,
					"content": "我尋思，它也許是覺得我挖寶貝的速度太慢，想要換個合作夥伴了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510220,
					"content": "#旅行者，如果{F#妳}{M#你}有興趣的話，{F#妳}{M#你}願意來當這個合作尋寶的夥伴嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510221,
					"content": "我不擅長和仙靈交流…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510222
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510222,
					"content": "#哈哈哈，沒事沒事，這小傢伙好像還滿喜歡{F#妳}{M#你}的，{F#妳}{M#你}看它飄動得多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510223,
					"content": "#咳！不說這個，總之，{F#妳}{M#你}想試試和這小傢伙合作嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510224,
						726510225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510224,
					"content": "我試試吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510226,
					"content": "那太好了，我倆…不，我們三個，從現在開始就是合作關係了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510227,
					"content": "#這本冊子{F#妳}{M#你}收好，這上面標記的地方都是可能埋有寶藏的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510228,
					"content": "#沒有「尋寶仙靈」幫忙，我是絕對找不到那些寶藏的…所以，就交給{F#妳}{M#你}了，旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510229,
						726510231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510229,
					"content": "找到寶藏後歸誰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510230,
					"content": "#這個嘛…找到寶藏後，裡面的寶貝都歸{F#妳}{M#你}，我分文不取。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510233,
					"content": "#但是{F#妳}{M#你}在挖寶藏的時候，也許有時候會發現「鐵錢」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510234,
					"content": "#如果{F#妳}{M#你}發現了「鐵錢」的話，請把這種古代錢幣帶來給我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510235,
					"content": "雖然一般的商人不會收這種東西，但我會出個好價錢收購的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510236,
					"content": "#那麼，這本冊子{F#妳}{M#你}拿好，然後帶著那個小傢伙吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510237,
					"content": "#祝{F#妳}{M#你}尋寶愉快，同時嘛…也願咱們合作愉快。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510231,
					"content": "#那些寶藏，{F#妳}{M#你}我各分一半。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510232,
					"content": "#喲，沒想到{F#妳}{M#你}還懂點規矩。嗯，不過這些寶藏我就不拿了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510225,
					"content": "希望它能喜歡我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510206,
					"content": "聽起來就很可疑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510207
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}